<title>FRANCE: EU grants 89,200 tonnes barley - traders.</title>
<headline>EU grants 89,200 tonnes barley - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted licences to export 89,200 tonnes of free-market barley to non-EU countries at a maximum rebate of 15.90 Ecus per tonne, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>There was no immediate confirmation.</p>
</text>
